{"v":4,"catch":"摧毀最後的武器！","desc":"《FINEST HOUR》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1989年發行的動作遊戲。\n駕駛最新的機器人“SYGNUS”並及時到達目標。\n使用“VERNIER”（jump）、“MARKER”和“SHOT”三個按鈕穿過舞台並擊敗敵人。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-09-28","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f3344abf18fbe26a7169f3c5623f3589adec6611582f61bb71f62837ce28d3e5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec5165b9a8cec44af33b71ede959380505041cd2808e73b097aa9691cb134070.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/91ef9aad73515d6a2dbe63f6ff4acac34e13c0460f667ffff7944c47c7920877.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8246f337a12b479dc0d2af8ce62eb0c98b62dc12d1a49039736655271baf2df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ffffe90c330ec34751cfe3f894f63b87564d0843cfc20f84678b21a152b380f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/51c08ee6c12146f8140e41538b9be231abe714ccce74255ed506e6229540488e.jpg"],"titleId":"010008a01962e000","dlc":[]}